cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SCDAid
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Hybrid evidence-based and machine-learning clinical decision-support
  research prototype for opioid strategy ranking in adult sickle-cell
  vaso-occlusive crisis. The included datasets are synthetic simulation
  data. The current ML model is a proof-of-concept trained on
  evidence-informed synthetic simulation data and has not established
  clinical predictive validity.
authors:
  - name: SCDAid contributors
keywords:
  - sickle cell disease
  - vaso-occlusive crisis
  - clinical decision support
  - pharmacogenomics
  - CYP2D6
  - synthetic data
